{
    "id": "T1600.002-DisableCryptoHardware",
    "name": "Disable Crypto Hardware",
    "description": "Adversaries disable a network device’s dedicated hardware encryption, which may enable them to leverage weaknesses in software encryption in order to reduce the effort involved in collecting, manipulating, and exfiltrating transmitted data.\n\nMany network devices such as routers, switches, and firewalls, perform encryption on network traffic to secure transmission across networks. Often, these devices are equipped with special, dedicated encryption hardware to greatly increase the speed of the encryption process as well as to prevent malicious tampering. When an adversary takes control of such a device, they may disable the dedicated hardware, for example, through use of Modify System Image, forcing the use of software to perform encryption on general processors. This is typically used in conjunction with attacks to weaken the strength of the cipher in software (e.g., Reduce Key Space).",
    "severity": "high",
    "mitre_attack": {
        "tactic": "TA0005",
        "technique_id": "T1600",
        "subtechnique_id": "T1600.002",
        "data_sources": [
            "Enterprise:Defense Evasion:Weaken Encryption:Disable Crypto Hardware",
            "Enterprise:Execution:Command and Scripting Interpreter:Windows Command Shell",
            "Enterprise:Execution:Command and Scripting Interpreter:PowerShell",
            "Enterprise:Defense Evasion:File and Directory Permissions Modification:Windows File and Directory Permissions Modification",
            "Enterprise:Defense Evasion:Modify Registry"
        ]
    },
    "platform": [
        "windows"
    ],
    "detection": {
        "selections": {
            "s1_process_create_action": {
                "event_type": "process",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.action",
                        "operator": "equals",
                        "value": "create"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "s2_cmdline_sc_stop_crypto_service": {
                "event_type": "process",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "sc.exe"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "stop"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "CNGKeyIsolation"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "KeyIso"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "TPM"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "s3_cmdline_sc_config_disable_crypto_service": {
                "event_type": "process",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "sc.exe"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "config"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "start= disabled"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "CNGKeyIsolation"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "KeyIso"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "TPM"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "s4_cmdline_powershell_set_service_crypto": {
                "event_type": "process",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "powershell.exe"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "Set-Service"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "-Status Stopped"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "-StartupType Disabled"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "CNGKeyIsolation"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "KeyIso"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "TPM"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "s5_cmdline_reg_modify_crypto_keys": {
                "event_type": "process",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "reg.exe"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "add"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "delete"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Cryptography"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.process.commandline",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Cryptography"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "s6_registry_modify_action": {
                "event_type": "registry",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.registry.keyclass",
                        "operator": "equals",
                        "value": "RegNtSetValueKey"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.registry.keyclass",
                        "operator": "equals",
                        "value": "RegNtDeleteValueKey"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.registry.keyclass",
                        "operator": "equals",
                        "value": "RegNtRenameKey"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "s7_registry_name_crypto_config_keys": {
                "event_type": "registry",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.registry.name",
                        "operator": "startswith",
                        "value": "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Cryptography"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.registry.name",
                        "operator": "startswith",
                        "value": "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Cryptography"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.registry.name",
                        "operator": "startswith",
                        "value": "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\CNGKeyIsolation"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.registry.name",
                        "operator": "startswith",
                        "value": "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\KeyIso"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.registry.name",
                        "operator": "startswith",
                        "value": "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\TPM"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "s8_filesystem_modify_action": {
                "event_type": "filesystem",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.filesystem.action",
                        "operator": "equals",
                        "value": "write"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.filesystem.action",
                        "operator": "equals",
                        "value": "overwritten"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.filesystem.action",
                        "operator": "equals",
                        "value": "superseded"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.filesystem.action",
                        "operator": "equals",
                        "value": "remove"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "s9_filesystem_filepath_critical_crypto_files": {
                "event_type": "filesystem",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "field": "body.filesystem.filepath",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "C:\\Windows\\System32\\crypt32.dll"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.filesystem.filepath",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "C:\\Windows\\System32\\bcrypt.dll"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.filesystem.filepath",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "C:\\Windows\\System32\\drivers\\cng.sys"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.filesystem.filepath",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "C:\\Windows\\System32\\drivers\\tpm.sys"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "body.filesystem.filepath",
                        "operator": "contains",
                        "value": "C:\\Windows\\System32\\drivers\\ksecdd.sys"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "condition": "s1_process_create_action and (s2_cmdline_sc_stop_crypto_service or s3_cmdline_sc_config_disable_crypto_service or s4_cmdline_powershell_set_service_crypto or s5_cmdline_reg_modify_crypto_keys) or (s6_registry_modify_action and s7_registry_name_crypto_config_keys) or (s8_filesystem_modify_action and s9_filesystem_filepath_critical_crypto_files)"
    },
    "operational_usage": "SOC 팀은 이 규칙을 활용하여 시스템의 암호화 하드웨어 비활성화 시도를 탐지할 수 있습니다. 이는 `sc.exe`, `powershell.exe`, `reg.exe`와 같은 시스템 도구를 사용하여 암호화 관련 서비스(예: CNGKeyIsolation, TPM)를 중지하거나 비활성화하려는 명령줄 활동, 또는 암호화 구성 레지스트리 키 및 핵심 암호화 드라이버 파일에 대한 직접적인 수정 시도를 모니터링합니다. 탐지된 이벤트는 높은 심각도로 분류되어 즉각적인 알람을 트리거하고, 추가적인 포렌식 조사 및 침해사고 대응의 우선순위를 지정하는 데 활용될 수 있습니다. 특히, 다른 방어 회피 또는 시스템 변경 활동과 결합될 때 중요도가 더욱 높아집니다.",
    "false_positive": "정상적인 시스템 유지보수, 드라이버 업데이트, 보안 소프트웨어 설치/제거, 또는 특정 기업 환경에서 암호화 설정을 관리하는 합법적인 스크립트나 도구에 의해 오탐이 발생할 수 있습니다. 알려진 정상적인 프로세스나 명령줄 패턴, 특정 레지스트리/파일 경로에 대한 화이트리스트를 적용하여 오탐을 줄일 수 있습니다."
}